{
 "title": "Today",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Today",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c245",
     "shot": "td_nine",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Add up every one of those rushes.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c246",
     "shot": "td_nine",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And today about one in every nine Americans lives in California.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c247",
     "shot": "td_bill",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the bill has arrived.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c248",
     "shot": "td_bill",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A typical home costs about twice the American average.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c249",
     "shot": "td_bill",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "More people sleep on the street here than in any other state.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c250",
     "shot": "td_fire",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And the fires keep getting bigger.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c251",
     "shot": "td_fire",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 2018, a single fire erased a town called Paradise.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c252",
     "shot": "td_fire",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In January 2025, fires burned into Los Angeles itself and took more than 16,000 buildings.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c253",
     "shot": "td_fire",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Remember the small, careful fires from the very beginning?",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c254",
     "shot": "td_fire",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "California is now working with the tribes to bring those fires back.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c255",
     "shot": "td_ai",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And there is a new rush.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c256",
     "shot": "td_ai",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Artificial intelligence.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "riser",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c257",
     "shot": "td_ai",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Once again, the world is running to San Francisco.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c258",
     "shot": "td_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So. The question I promised you at the start.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c259",
     "shot": "td_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Who actually gets rich in California?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c260",
     "shot": "td_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Not the man who found the gold.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:gold.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c261",
     "shot": "td_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Not the man who owned the land.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:land.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c262",
     "shot": "td_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Sam Brannan, the shopkeeper with the shovels? He became California's first millionaire.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c263",
     "shot": "td_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then he lost it all and died with almost nothing.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:lost",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c264",
     "shot": "td_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The railroad? Four shopkeepers.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:shopkeepers.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c265",
     "shot": "td_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The water? The men who bought the land first.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:land",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c266",
     "shot": "td_levi",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And one more shopkeeper.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c267",
     "shot": "td_levi",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He arrived in San Francisco in 1853.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c268",
     "shot": "td_levi",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He never dug for gold.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c269",
     "shot": "td_levi",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Not once.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c270",
     "shot": "td_levi",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He sold cloth.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c271",
     "shot": "td_levi",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then in 1873, he and a tailor put metal rivets on a pair of work pants.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "anvil",
       "w:rivets",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c272",
     "shot": "td_levi",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "His name was *Levi* Strauss.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Levi",
       0.6
      ],
      [
       "sparkle",
       "w:Strauss.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c273",
     "shot": "td_chips",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in today's rush? One of the most valuable companies on Earth is not digging for AI gold at all.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c274",
     "shot": "td_chips",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It sits in Santa Clara and it sells the chips.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c275",
     "shot": "td_chips",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The shovels.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:shovels.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c276",
     "shot": "td_gone",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The gold ran out.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "end",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c277",
     "shot": "td_gone",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The grizzly is gone.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "end",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c278",
     "shot": "td_gone",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The island never existed.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "end",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c279",
     "shot": "td_jeans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But look down.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c280",
     "shot": "td_jeans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The jeans are *still* here.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "sparkle",
       "w:jeans",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c281",
     "shot": "td_end",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That is the entire history of California.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c282",
     "shot": "td_end",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Everybody comes for the gold.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c283",
     "shot": "td_end",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The smart ones sell the *shovels.*",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:shovels.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}